WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.269
Now meet the Agent Forge. Build a specialist with your team's know-how: a role, your documents, and the rules it always follows.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:14.754
Describe the job in plain English, choose its skills, and decide what it may touch: read only, ask first, or allowed.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:22.431
Then teach it. Point it at past jobs, specs and price lists. It studies them right on your machine, and maps what it knows.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:29.715
When your documents disagree, it asks. Two past bids used different waste factors. Pick the right one, and it becomes a house rule.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:36.618
Or let it train itself. It plans a learning path for its role, then sends researchers out to read up on every topic.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:43.007
Then it writes exams with real answers from your own files, and takes them, so you can see exactly what it passed.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:51.726
Then put it to work. Give it a task, and watch its plan, its progress, and everything it produced, with approvals whenever it needs you.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:03.566
Every agent you forge lives in the Fleet. Launch them, share them, or put several on one mission.
